        "value": "Only ferrite and austenite detected; no significant change in peak intensity after 773 K/3 h aging. For 773 K/3 h (0.02Nb): austenite (111) Θ=21.217, β=0.428, βcosθ=0.399, 4sinθ=1.448; (200) Θ=24.552, β=0.572, βcosθ=0.520, 4sinθ=1.662; (220) Θ=36.253, β=0.601, βcosθ=0.485, 4sinθ=2.365. Ferrite (110): Θ=22.453, β=0.428, βcosθ=0.395, 4sinθ=1.528.",
